msgid ""
"**Instrumentation:** `llvm/lib/Transforms/Instrumentation/"
"MemProfInstrumentation.cpp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:192
msgid "Implements the LLVM IR pass that adds instrumentation calls."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:194
msgid ""
"**Profile Data:** `llvm/include/llvm/ProfileData/MemProf.h` and "
"`MemProfData.inc`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:196
msgid ""
"Defines the profile format, data structures (like `MemInfoBlock`), and "
"serialization logic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:198
msgid "**Use Pass:** `llvm/lib/Transforms/Instrumentation/MemProfUse.cpp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:200
msgid "Reads the profile and annotates the IR with metadata."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:202
msgid ""
"**Context Disambiguation:** `llvm/lib/Transforms/IPO/"
"MemProfContextDisambiguation.cpp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:204
msgid ""
"Implements the analysis and transformations (e.g., cloning) for resolving "
"ambiguous allocation contexts using LTO."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:206
msgid "**Transformation:** `llvm/lib/Transforms/Utils/SimplifyLibCalls.cpp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:208
msgid ""
"Implements the rewriting of allocation calls based on the hot/cold hints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:210
msgid ""
"**Static Data Partitioning:** `llvm/lib/CodeGen/AsmPrinter/AsmPrinter.cpp`, "
"`llvm/lib/CodeGen/StaticDataSplitter.cpp`, and `llvm/lib/CodeGen/"
"StaticDataAnnotator.cpp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:212
msgid ""
"Implements the splitting of static data (Jump tables, Module-internal global "
"variables, and Constant pools) into hot and cold sections using branch "
"profile data. `StaticDataAnnotator` iterates over global variables and sets "
"their section prefixes based on the profile analysis from "
"`StaticDataSplitter`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:214
msgid "Runtime Implementation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:216
msgid ""
"The runtime uses a **shadow memory** scheme similar to AddressSanitizer "
"(ASan) but optimized for profiling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:218
msgid "**Shadow Mapping:** Application memory is mapped to shadow memory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:219
msgid ""
"**Granularity:** The default granularity is 64 bytes. One byte of shadow "
"memory tracks the access state of 64 bytes of application memory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:220
msgid ""
"**MemInfoBlock (MIB):** A key data structure that aggregates runtime "
"statistics for each profiled allocation context, including allocation volume "
"(`AllocCount`, `TotalSize`), object lifetime (`TotalLifetime`, `Min/"
"MaxLifetime`), memory access counts (`TotalAccessCount`, `Min/"
"MaxAccessCount`), and lifetime access density (`TotalLifetimeAccessDensity`, "
"`Min/MaxAccessDensity`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:222
msgid "Profile Format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:224
msgid ""
"The MemProf profile is a schema-based binary format designed for "
"extensibility. Key structures include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:226
msgid ""
"**Frame:** Represents a function in the call stack (Function GUID, Line, "
"Column)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:227
msgid ""
"**CallStack:** A sequence of Frames identifying the context of an allocation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:228
msgid "**MemInfoBlock:** The statistics gathered for a specific CallStack."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:230
msgid ""
"The format supports versioning to allow adding new fields to the MIB without "
"breaking backward compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:232
msgid "Static Data Profile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:234
msgid ""
"To support static data partitioning, the profile format includes a payload "
"for symbolized data access profiles. This maps data addresses to canonical "
"symbol names (or module source location for internal data) and access "
"counts. This enables the compiler to identify which global variables are hot."
msgstr ""

