#: ../../../MemPGO.md:264
msgid ""
"You can create MemProf profiles in YAML format for testing purposes. This is "
"useful for creating small, self-contained test cases without needing to run "
"a binary."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:266
msgid ""
"**Create a YAML Profile:** You can start by dumping a real profile to YAML "
"(see {ref}`Processing Profiles <processing-profiles>` above) or writing one "
"from scratch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:268
msgid ""
"**Convert to Indexed Format:** Use `llvm-profdata` to convert the YAML to "
"the indexed MemProf format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:274
msgid "**Run the Compiler:** Use the indexed profile with `opt` or `clang`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../MemPGO.md:280
msgid "**Example YAML Profile:**"
msgstr ""
